{
  "post": {
    "id": "13162309",
    "published": "2017-11-18T02:30:17.000Z",
    "title": "アー写と特典とリリイベとMVと私の小話o(･x･)/🌸💠🏵",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13162309.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180121091022/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13162309.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です(*´ー｀*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家好，我是鹿乃(*´ー｀*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, it's Kano(*´ー｀*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日また追加でドン、ドン、ドドンパと色々情報がきましたね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天又咚、咚、咚咚啪地接连追加了一堆新消息呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yesterday even more news came in, bam, bam, ba-bam!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ブログにわかりやすくまとめちゃいます。告知だけだと寂しいのでポエミーな鹿乃の小話も混ぜあわせながら書き書きしていきます✏︎"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我会在博客里把消息整理得清清楚楚。光是干巴巴的公告总觉得太冷清，所以就掺上一点充满诗意的鹿乃式小话，一边写一边聊吧✏︎"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm going to sum it all up neatly on the blog. An announcement alone would be lonely, so I'll mix in a poetic little story from Kano as I write ✏︎"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "✂︎ ーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "新しいアー写が公開されました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "新的艺人照公开啦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A new artist photo has been released."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1162.JPG",
            "source": "https://www.lisani.jp/admin/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/1711201336-mk-001.jpg",
            "media": "dde1ca53f49d.jpg",
            "recovery": "stand-in"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "頭のお花は生け花方式でぶすぶすぶす。ひとつひとつ丁寧にさされています🌻人生で一番いいにおいしそうな見た目の鹿乃に仕上がってます。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "头上的花是按插花的样式一朵一朵\"噗嗤噗嗤\"插进去的，每一朵都被仔仔细细地安放好🌻 于是诞生了一版\"看起来是我人生中最香\"的鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The flowers on my head are stuck in ikebana-style, poke poke poke. Each one was put in carefully 🌻 I ended up looking like the best-smelling, most delicious-looking Kano of my whole life."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "それにしても実写な鹿乃さん慣れませんね。本人が一番もしかして慣れてないかも？！みんなはそろそろ慣れてきたのかな〜〜📸"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "话说回来，还是不太习惯真人出镜的鹿乃呀。说不定最不习惯的人其实是本人我？！大家是不是已经慢慢习惯了呢〜〜📸"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Still, I can't get used to a live-action Kano. Maybe I'm the one who's least used to it?! Have you all gotten used to it by now~~ 📸"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1163.JPG",
            "source": "https://www.lisani.jp/admin/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/1711201336-mk-009.jpg",
            "media": "6b38731a2918.jpg",
            "recovery": "stand-in"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1163.JPG",
            "source": "https://www.lisani.jp/admin/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/1711201336-mk-007.jpg",
            "media": "4cf00a3f367d.jpg",
            "recovery": "stand-in"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1163.JPG",
            "source": "https://www.lisani.jp/admin/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/1711201336-mk-008.jpg",
            "media": "8b2fe3d7c458.jpg",
            "recovery": "stand-in"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1163.JPG",
            "source": "https://www.lisani.jp/admin/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/1711201336-mk-006.jpg",
            "media": "bb08070cf397.jpg",
            "recovery": "stand-in"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2ndアルバム「アルストロメリア」\n店舗別 購入者特典 絵柄\n【Amazon.co.jp限定】オリジナル缶バッジ\n【とらのあな】A4クリアファイル\n【TSUTAYA】複製サイン＆コメント入ブロマイド\n【お渡し会イベント用】A4クリアファイル"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二张专辑《阿尔斯特罗梅利亚》\n各店铺 购入者特典 图案\n【Amazon.co.jp限定】原创徽章\n【虎之穴】A4透明文件夹\n【TSUTAYA】带复制签名和留言的写真卡\n【亲手递交会活动用】A4透明文件夹"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2nd album \"Alstroemeria\"\nStore-specific purchase bonus designs\n[Amazon.co.jp exclusive] Original button badge\n[Toranoana] A4 clear file\n[TSUTAYA] Reproduction autograph and comment bromide\n[For the handing-over event] A4 clear file"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1164.JPG",
            "source": "https://www.lisani.jp/admin/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/1711201336-mk-005.jpg",
            "media": "8d9147ab5a24.jpg",
            "recovery": "stand-in"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "【初回生産限定盤特典】  アクリルキーホルダー"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "【初回生产限定盘特典】亚克力钥匙扣"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Limited first press edition bonus] Acrylic keychain"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "リリイベ参加券"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "发售活动参加券"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Release event participation tickets"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "TIf77SBhaX.jpg",
            "remote": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hvSOwxCewKXxyDgUUBQRWKzBTLxMLbTN0GHY-RgdYI1IHYj58GnQ8SghQawU3fwp5Fz01RzxeIzUdTjZjBW0tfg1HIT4dYAdIDC4wBlcKd01XOWwjT2xmEgINd0RdOysrSG01SlcLIg/small",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hvSOwxCewKXxyDgUUBQRWKzBTLxMLbTN0GHY-RgdYI1IHYj58GnQ8SghQawU3fwp5Fz01RzxeIzUdTjZjBW0tfg1HIT4dYAdIDC4wBlcKd01XOWwjT2xmEgINd0RdOysrSG01SlcLIg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "↑ アニメイトさんの参加券頒布状況です。東京にお住いの方はなるべく早めに、関西名古屋の方はお誘い合わせの上どしどしどしとお願いしますo(･x･)/きてきてきてきてください〜"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "↑这是animate店的参加券发放情况。住在东京的朋友请尽量趁早行动，关西和名古屋的朋友请互相约好，踊跃踊跃踊跃地来吧o(･x･)/ 快来快来快来快来呀〜"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "↑ This is how Animate's participation tickets are going. If you live in Tokyo, please come as early as you can, and for those in Kansai and Nagoya, please get together and come in droves, droves, droves o(･x･)/ Please come come come come come~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "タワーレコードさんもまだあります。タワーレコードさんはありがたいことに電話受付を対象店舗様でしているので、遠方に住んでる方でリリイベ参加したいと思ってくださっている方にはオススメです💡"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tower Records 也还有名额。令人感激的是，Tower Records 在部分对象店铺支持电话预约，所以住在远方又想参加发售活动的朋友，我非常推荐这家💡"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tower Records still has some too. Thankfully, Tower Records takes phone reservations at the participating stores, so I recommend it for anyone who lives far away and wants to join a release event 💡"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "とらのあなさん、TSUTAYAさんもまだ残っていますのでぜひぜひご参加ください！リリイベは当たり前かもですがCDリリースがないとできないので、後ろ向きな話で申し訳ないのですが次があるか本当に毎回謎なのです。次があるように頑張るよ〜〜ってリリイベ終わり際いつも切ない気持ちに実はなってました(´；ω；`)笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "虎之穴和 TSUTAYA 也都还有剩余，请务必务必来参加！发售活动虽然可能是理所当然的，但没有 CD 发行就没法举办，所以说这种消极的话很抱歉，但真的每次都不知道还有没有下一次。为了能有下一次，我会加油的〜〜其实每次发售活动临近结束时，我心里都忍不住涌上一阵淡淡的伤感(´；ω；`) 笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Toranoana and TSUTAYA still have tickets left too, so please do join us! It may be obvious, but a release event can't happen without a CD release, so I'm sorry to be negative, but every single time it's a mystery whether there will be a next one. Honestly, at the end of release events I always felt a bit sad, thinking \"I'll do my best so there's a next time~~\" (´；ω；`) lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今回は握手会、トークショー、お渡し会、サイン会と色んな種類があるのでお好きなものに参加していただけたらと思います！お待ちしてます！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这次的活动有握手会、谈话秀、亲手递交会、签名会等好多种形式，大家挑喜欢的来参加就好！等着你们来！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This time there are lots of different kinds: handshake events, talk shows, handing-over events, and signing events, so I hope you'll join whichever one you like! I'll be waiting for you!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "youtube",
        "videoId": "Fppdf8foYoA",
        "watch": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fppdf8foYoA",
        "video": "86492ace3fa1.mp4",
        "cover": "0a773c412713.jpg",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180121091022/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fppdf8foYoA",
        "coverSource": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fppdf8foYoA/hqdefault.jpg"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アルストロメリアの収録曲で、ダンメモ主題歌の「Ivy」のMVが投稿されました。今までとまた一味違った意思の強さを感じさせてくれるばんびちゃんの表情、想像力をかきたてる動画の動きが最高に好きです。まだ観てないよって方はぜひ観てくださいっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "收录于《阿尔斯特罗梅利亚》、作为《地错》手游主题曲的《Ivy》MV 已经发布啦。这次ばんびちゃん的表情带着一股与以往截然不同的坚定意志，那种激发想象力的画面运镜，我真是喜欢得不得了。还没看过的朋友请一定要去看看哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The MV for \"Ivy\", the DanMemo theme song and one of the tracks on Alstroemeria, has been posted. I absolutely love Banbi-chan's expression, which shows a different kind of strong will than before, and the movement in the video that sparks the imagination. If you haven't watched it yet, please do!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さてここからは小話です。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好了，接下来是小话时间。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now, here comes the little story."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_101APPLE_IMG_1149.JPG",
            "remote": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h3z_8jYCEbFViQUA97ugTAiAcajobInZdCDl7bxcXZnsXLXtVCjt5YxgfLgwxBnloJFhjOzA2YBgzdkNWLSV4VD8yNz1PDVVTWGVRL0dFMmRHdi8FWi4jOxUSO2ZMcG4CWCJwY04VZg/small",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h3z_8jYCEbFViQUA97ugTAiAcajobInZdCDl7bxcXZnsXLXtVCjt5YxgfLgwxBnloJFhjOzA2YBgzdkNWLSV4VD8yNz1PDVVTWGVRL0dFMmRHdi8FWi4jOxUSO2ZMcG4CWCJwY04VZg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "真冬でも冷たいものを鹿乃は外だと飲みます。めちゃくちゃ猫舌だからです。猫舌って食べ方？舌の位置に問題が〜〜と教えてもらいましたが、そんなの関係ない。あついものはあついんだ！！！！寒いけどあついんだ！！！！怒"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "鹿乃在室外的话，就算是大冬天也喝冰的东西。因为我是超怕烫的猫舌。虽然有人告诉过我\"猫舌难道是吃法的问题？说不定是舌头的位置有问题〜〜\"，但才不管那些呢。烫的东西就是烫！！！！！虽然冷但还是烫！！！！！哼"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Even in the middle of winter, I drink cold drinks when I'm outside. It's because I'm extremely sensitive to hot things. Someone told me it's about how you eat, or the position of your tongue or something, but that doesn't matter. Hot is hot!!!! It's cold out but it's hot!!!! (angry)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "正直、あったかいものをお外でも飲みたいです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "说实话，我也想在室外喝热乎乎的东西呀。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Honestly, I'd like to drink something warm outside too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
